            "detailed_description": "This wasn't Henry Shackelton's best day ever. He was a few tests away from making his obsession on bringing the people from the dead a reality. All in vain – his plans were fiercely interrupted by an attack of some bandits. All he's got left is 60 minutes of life.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The last 60 minutes</strong><br>This is the last hour of your life. Don't waste it. Do only things you consider important.<br></li><li><strong>Non-linear plot</strong><br>The world of 1896 is torn by conflicts. It's up to you which of them and how you'll deal with.<br></li><li><strong>12 possible endings</strong><br>Every decision brings irreversible consequences which will follow you until the end.<br></li><li><strong>Emotional soundtrack</strong><br>Richard Wurth is a true master of piano and cello. His unforgettable melodies will accompany you through the whole adventure.<br></li><li><strong>Handmade graphics</strong><br>Every location has been handmade to bring out its unique features.<br></li><li><strong>Steampunk</strong><br>The game's atmosphere is heavily based on historical events that appeared during The Industrial Revolution.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "This wasn't Henry Shackelton's best day ever. He was a few tests away from making his obsession on bringing the people from the dead a reality. All in vain – his plans were fiercely interrupted by an attack of some bandits. All he's got left is 60 minutes of life.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The last 60 minutes</strong><br>This is the last hour of your life. Don't waste it. Do only things you consider important.<br></li><li><strong>Non-linear plot</strong><br>The world of 1896 is torn by conflicts. It's up to you which of them and how you'll deal with.<br></li><li><strong>12 possible endings</strong><br>Every decision brings irreversible consequences which will follow you until the end.<br></li><li><strong>Emotional soundtrack</strong><br>Richard Wurth is a true master of piano and cello. His unforgettable melodies will accompany you through the whole adventure.<br></li><li><strong>Handmade graphics</strong><br>Every location has been handmade to bring out its unique features.<br></li><li><strong>Steampunk</strong><br>The game's atmosphere is heavily based on historical events that appeared during The Industrial Revolution.</li></ul>",
